    "description": "<p>As a Medic's medical skills grow, they gain insight into specific medical procedures and treatment of specific <a href=\"/wiki/Species\" title=\"Species\">Species</a>. At each even-numbered level (2nd, 4th, 6th and so on), the Medic gains a <a href=\"/wiki/Medical_Secret\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Medical Secret\">Medical Secret</a>, giving them a bonus when using a specific application of the <a href=\"/wiki/Treat_Injury\" title=\"Treat Injury\">Treat Injury</a> skill. A Medic can select a given treatment only once.</p>",
